@host = http://localhost:5192

### List reminders (page 1, open only, soonest first)
GET {{host}}/reminders?page=1&pageSize=10&status=Open&sortBy=dueDate&sortDir=asc
Accept: application/json

### Create a daily reminder
POST {{host}}/reminders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientName": "Jane Doe",
  "title": "Take blood pressure reading",
  "notes": "Morning, before medication",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-05T09:00:00Z",
  "recurrence": "Daily"
}

### Get one reminder
GET {{host}}/reminders/1

### Complete it (creates the next occurrence for Daily/Weekly)
POST {{host}}/reminders/1/complete

### Audit trail
GET {{host}}/reminders/1/history

### Validation error example (400)
POST {{host}}/reminders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "recurrence": "Monthly" }
